#: ../../language/error_codes/E4092.md:1
msgid "E4092"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4092.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `record_type_missing`."
msgstr "编译器诊断名称：`record_type_missing`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4092.md:5
msgid "Missing annotation for this empty struct."
msgstr "此空结构体缺少类型标注。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4092.md:7
msgid ""
"MoonBit needs a concrete struct type before it can type-check an empty "
"struct literal such as `T::{}`. In current compiler output, this diagnostic "
"can appear as a follow-up error when the type name itself cannot be "
"resolved."
msgstr ""
"MoonBit 需要确定具体的结构体类型，才能对 `T::{}` "
"这样的空结构体字面量进行类型检查。当类型名称本身无法解析时，当前编译器可能将此诊断作为后续错误报告。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4092.md:11
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4092.md:13
msgid ""
"This example reports E4024 for the unknown type and E4092 for the empty "
"struct literal whose type could not be resolved."
msgstr "此示例会针对未知类型报告 E4024，并针对无法确定类型的空结构体字面量报告 E4092。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4092.md:16
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn example() -> Unit {\n"
"  let _ = Missing::{}\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4092.md:20
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4092.md:22
msgid "Use a struct type that is defined and in scope:"
msgstr "使用已定义且在作用域内的结构体类型："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4092.md:24
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"priv struct Marker {}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn example() -> Unit {\n"
"  let _ = Marker::{}\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
